Package: kidvisionAccel
Title: Opinionated Accelerometer Processing and Reporting for the KidVision Project
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Taren", "Sanders", , "taren.sanders@acu.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4504-6008"))
Description: Processes accelerometer data for participants in the KidVision
    project. It finds participants whose data have not yet been processed in
    REDCap, copies their raw GENEActiv files from the project's OneDrive
    folder, processes them with a pinned version of 'GGIR' using settings
    chosen for primary-school children, imports the results into REDCap, and
    creates a summary report for each participant.
